- Record the recipient and communication method.
- Record communication attempts and timestamps.
- Record acknowledgement and recipient identity.
- Escalate failed contact according to policy.

Generating an alert does not prove that a clinician was notified.

Released reports must be protected from silent changes. Corrected reports and addenda must preserve prior versions and clearly identify the revision.

